Package: ggplot3d
Title: 3D Plots in the Grammar of Graphics
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Gilles", "Colling", email = "gilles.colling051@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3070-6066"))
Description: Draws three-dimensional points, paths, surfaces and solids within
    the grammar of graphics provided by 'ggplot2'. Trains a third position
    scale, combines layers into a shared panel scene, and resolves visibility
    for vector and raster output. Supports camera controls, faceting,
    statistical surfaces and indexed meshes.
